, or executing special combos, every move feels immersive and satisfying in VR.\n\nChoose your fighter, train your skills, and rise through intense stages to prove yourself as the champion. Perfect for fans of VR combat, martial-arts games, and action-packed fighting experiences.", "short_description": "Step into the arena and become a true VR fighter! Use joystick buttons to punch, kick, block, dodge, and unleash powerful combos. Battle skilled opponents in intense close-combat action and master martial-arts moves in fully immersive VR. Feel every hit, improve your skills, and rise to the top of the Fighting Arena!"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25111435061840471"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820428_1249128793698604_7710336989687949354_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KmgRLK21YgcQ7kNvwFWMXX4&_nc_oc=AdmteruCuqJb0-iNJJE2SAMV6RbS_t4-78eV3OpksCPRXjJU_z4WBN2pycVCY2A0hm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.ocul